# Web3Forms access key
#
# The site no longer reads the Web3Forms key from an env var.
# All form keys live in ONE file:
#   src/lib/forms.ts  ->  WEB3FORMS_CONTACT_KEY, WEB3FORMS_CUSTOM_ORDER_KEY (see FORM_KEYS)
# Edit them there and rebuild. The receiving inbox is managed in the Web3Forms dashboard.
